#: config.cpp:63
msgid "IceWM Theme Selector"
msgstr "Icewm Tema Kiesser"

#: config.cpp:67
msgid "Make your IceWM selection by clicking on a theme here. "
msgstr "Maak jou Icewm keuse deur te kliek op 'n tema hier. "

#: config.cpp:70
msgid ""
"To manage your IceWM themes, simply click on the link below to open a "
"Konqueror window. Once shown, you will be able to add or remove native IceWM "
"themes, by uncompressing <b>http://icewm.themes.org/</b> theme files into "
"this directory, or creating directory symlinks to existing IceWM themes on "
"your system."
msgstr ""
"Na bestuur jou Icewm temas, eenvoudig kliek op die skakel onder Na open 'n "
"Konqueror venster. As eers vertoon, jy sal wees in staat Na voeg deur of "
"verwyder plaaslike Icewm temas, deur te dekompreseer "
"<b>http://Icewm.temas.org/</b> tema lêers binnein hierdie gids, of te skep "
"gids simboliese skakels Na bestaande Icewm temas op jou stelsel."

#: config.cpp:79
msgid "Open Konqueror window at KDE's IceWM theme directory"
msgstr ""

#: config.cpp:82
msgid "IceWM Decoration Settings"
msgstr "Icewm Versiering Instellings"

#: config.cpp:85
msgid "Use theme &title text colors"
msgstr "Gebruik tema titel teks kleure"

#: config.cpp:88
msgid ""
"When selected, titlebar colors will follow those set in the IceWM theme. If "
"not selected, the current KDE titlebar colors will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer gekose, titelbar kleure sal volg daardie stel in die Icewm tema. As "
"nie gekose, die huidige Kde titelbar kleure sal wees gebruik word in plaas "
"van."

#: config.cpp:93
msgid "&Show title bar on top of windows"
msgstr "Vertoon titel kolom op bo van vensters"

#: config.cpp:96
msgid ""
"When selected, all window titlebars will be shown at the top of each window, "
"otherwise they will be shown at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer gekose, alle venster titelbalk sal wees vertoon na die bo van elke "
"venster, andersins hulle sal wees vertoon na die bodem."

#: config.cpp:101
msgid "&Menu button always shows application mini icon"
msgstr "Kieslys knoppie altyd vertoon aansoek mini ikoon"

#: config.cpp:104
msgid ""
"When selected, all titlebar menu buttons will have the application icon "
"shown. If not selected, the current theme's defaults are used instead."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer gekose, alle titelbar kieslys knoppies sal het die aansoek ikoon "
"vertoon. As nie gekose, die huidige tema se verstek word gebruik word in "
"plaas van."

#: config.cpp:174 config.cpp:216 config.cpp:260 config.cpp:275
msgid "Infadel #2 (default)"
msgstr "Infadel #2 (verstek)"
